   ],
   "spoken": "After the knight to c3 the Open Sicilian reaches its great fork: the fianchetto to g6 is the Dragon, the knight to c6 is the Classical, and the little pawn to a6 is the Najdorf — each a different world.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "The 5th-move choice defines your whole Sicilian — Dragon, Classical, or Najdorf.",
   "plans": "Pick the Najdorf: maximum flexibility."
