   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/1p2pppp/p2p1n2/8/3NP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "a6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The pawn to a6 is the Najdorf — the most respected Sicilian of all. It takes the b5-square away from White's pieces and keeps every plan open, deciding on the setup only after White commits.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "…a6 is prophylaxis plus flexibility — it denies b5 and delays Black's commitment.",
   "plans": "Wait for White's system, then choose …e5 or …e6 accordingly."
